# KEYS: find

## Most Common Usage
```bash
find . -type f -iname '*.mp4'
```
*Recursively searches the current directory (`.`) for files (`-type f`) with a case-insensitive name (`-iname`) ending in `.mp4`.*

---

## Searching Basics

### Search by Name (Case-Sensitive)
```bash
find /path -name "filename.txt"
```

### Search by Name (Case-Insensitive)
```bash
find /path -iname "filename.txt"
```

### Search by Type
```bash
find . -type d -name "config"   # Search for directories only
find . -type f -name "config"   # Search for files only
find . -type l -name "link"     # Search for symbolic links
```

### Search by File Size
```bash
find . -size +100M    # Files larger than 100MB
find . -size -10k     # Files smaller than 10KB
find . -size 50M      # Files exactly 50MB
```

---

## Time-Based Searching

### Based on Modification Time (mtime)
```bash
find . -mtime -1      # Files modified within the last 24 hours
find . -mtime +30     # Files modified more than 30 days ago
```

### Based on Access Time (atime)
```bash
find . -atime -7      # Files accessed within the last 7 days
```

---

## Executing Commands

### Remove Files with Specific Word
```bash
find . -name '*example*' -exec rm -v {} +
```
*Finds matches and executes `rm -v` on the results. The `{}` is a placeholder for the results, and `+` groups arguments for efficiency.*

### Change Permissions
```bash
find . -type d -exec chmod 755 {} +
find . -type f -exec chmod 644 {} +
```

### Interactive Deletion
```bash
find . -name "*.log" -ok rm {} \;
```
*Uses `-ok` instead of `-exec` to prompt for confirmation before every action.*

---

## Advanced Filtering

### Search for Empty Files/Directories
```bash
find . -empty
```

### Search by Permissions
```bash
find . -perm 777
```

### Search Multiple Patterns (OR Logic)
```bash
find . \( -name "*.sh" -o -name "*.bash" \)
```

### Limit Search Depth
```bash
find . -maxdepth 1 -name "*.txt"
```
*Prevents `find` from descending into subdirectories.*

---

## Option Reference Table

| Option | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| `-name` | Search by filename (case-sensitive) |
| `-iname` | Search by filename (case-insensitive) |
| `-type` | Filter by type (`f`=file, `d`=directory, `l`=link) |
| `-size` | Filter by size (`k`, `M`, `G`) |
| `-mtime` | Days since last modification |
| `-atime` | Days since last access |
| `-user` | Search for files owned by a specific user |
| `-perm` | Search for files with specific permissions |
| `-exec` | Run a command on search results |
| `-delete` | Directly delete found files (use with caution) |

